1
00:00:00,844 --> 00:00:02,924
(Leonard:)Actually, it's not all that easy to find.

2
00:00:03,096 --> 00:00:06,556
Yeah, really? Well, my friends at work
found it, my sister found it.

3
00:00:06,725 --> 00:00:11,775
(Penny:)Judging by my e-mail, a number of prisoners
at the Michigan State Penitentiary found it.

4
00:00:11,938 --> 00:00:13,898
What exactly did this guy write?

5
00:00:14,065 --> 00:00:16,655
(Leonard:)Not that I need to know
the details of your sex life.

6
00:00:16,818 --> 00:00:18,028
(Leonard:)I just thought...

7
00:00:18,486 --> 00:00:20,116
(Leonard:)Never mind.

8
00:00:20,530 --> 00:00:22,070
No, you know what?

9
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:25,450
(Penny:)Might as well read it,
everybody else has. Go ahead.

10
00:00:25,618 --> 00:00:29,038
(Penny:)Oh, God, I just feel so betrayed
and embarrassed.

11
00:00:29,205 --> 00:00:32,495
I just wanna crawl into a hole and die.

12
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,170
(Leonard:)Okay, well, you know, this isn't that bad.

13
00:00:38,673 --> 00:00:41,803
(Leonard:)It just paints the picture
of a very affectionate woman...

14
00:00:41,968 --> 00:00:47,308
(Leonard:)...who's open to expressing her affection
in nontraditional locales.

15
00:00:47,474 --> 00:00:49,304
(Penny:)Oh, God.

16
00:00:49,476 --> 00:00:54,606
Elevators, parks, movie theaters.

17
00:00:55,523 --> 00:00:56,903
(Leonard:)Out of curiosity...

18
00:00:57,067 --> 00:01:02,027
(Leonard:)...is this subway, the transportation system,
or Subway, the sandwich shop?

